<title>USA: Chandler Insurance Co Ltd Q3 net drops.</title>
<headline>Chandler Insurance Co Ltd Q3 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Amounts in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>				     For the three months ended</p>
<p>						September 30,	     %</p>
<p>						1996	   1995  Change</p>
<p> Total revenues			   26,351	24,445     8%</p>
<p> Total operating expenses	     25,630	23,074    11%</p>
<p> Net income before income taxes	  721	 1,371  (47%)</p>
<p>Income tax provision of U.S.</p>
<p>   subsidiaries			    (184)	 (511)  (64%)</p>
<p> Net income				    537	   860  (38%)</p>
<p> Net income per share		     0.08	  0.12  (33%)</p>
<p>Weighted average common shares and</p>
<p>common share equivalents</p>
<p>   outstanding			     6,942	 6,942     0%</p>
<p>		    (Amounts in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>				   For the nine months ended</p>
<p>						 September 30,</p>
<p>										%</p>
<p>						  1996	 1995  Change</p>
<p> Total revenues			   75,031     68,508     10%</p>
<p> Total operating expenses	     74,354     65,803     13%</p>
<p> Net income before income taxes	  677	2,705   (75%)</p>
<p>Income tax benefit (provision) of</p>
<p>   U.S. Subsidiaries			 790	(239)  (431%)</p>
<p> Net income				  1,467	2,466   (41%)</p>
<p> Net income per share		     0.21	 0.36   (42%)</p>
<p>Weighted average common shares and</p>
<p>common share equivalents</p>
<p>   outstanding			     6,942	6,942	0%</p>
<p>NOTE: Chandler Insurance is based in Grand Cayman, Cayman Islands.  </p>
<p>Chandler said earnings for the 1996 quarter and nine months were hurt by a $1.0 million charge and an additional $175,000 in related expenses due to legal proceedings and related matters arising from the termination of an underwriting and production contract with Midwest Indemnity Corp.</p>
<p>The 1996 year to date results also reflect a charge and related expenses totaling $1.6 million from a second quarter arbitration award that was lower than expected.</p>
<p>Excluding the effects of these and other non-recurring charges and related expenses and the estimated recovery, net income was $655,000 and $2.6 million for the quarter and nine months ended September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
